# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Source data and everything derived from it.
#   None of it is distributable. data_raw/ holds the delivered sources, the
#   other two hold what the pipeline writes from them; the intermediate files
#   still carry identifiers, addresses and matching metadata.
#   The one exception is the metering-unit conversion table, which the README
#   says ships with the code.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data_raw/*
!data_raw/공통코드.xlsx
data_prepared/
data_output/
figures/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The real manual exclusion list holds ykiho values, which are pseudonymous
# keys that can be resolved to named institutions through public
# health-insurance data. Only the template is distributed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
manual_exclusions.csv
manual_exclusions_test.csv

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Personal working notes kept alongside the code but not part of the release.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
_*.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
~$*
